ment\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://gamebuegar.itch.io/colonyadventure/devlog\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4331854/colonyadventure\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" role=\"img\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">MiniColonyAdventures \u2013 Build, Expand &amp; Survive</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_9883459\" itemscope><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, Linux, and Android</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://gamebuegar.itch.io/colonyadventure/purchase\">Download or claim</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><a class=\"sale_link\" href=\"https://itch.io/s/197030/im-offering-a-discount-on-my-game\"><div class=\"sale_label\"><div class=\"main_label\">On Sale!</div><div class=\"sub_label\"><span class=\"sale_rate\">100%</span> Off</div></div></a><span class=\"dollars original_price\">$1.50</span> <span class=\"dollars\" itemprop=\"price\">$0.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><em></em></p>\r\n<h1>ColonyAdventure: A Village Life Mini-Game</h1>\r\n<p>Welcome to <strong>ColonyAdventure</strong>, a deeply interactive and charming village simulation game where every decision shapes the future of your settlement! Start with a humble campfire in the wilderness and guide your colonists to build a thriving, self-sustaining village.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Will your people flourish and build a peaceful community, or will the harsh elements take over?\r\n</p>\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features</h3>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Smart Autonomous Colonists:</strong> Your villagers aren&#x27;t just mindless workers. They have distinct individual needs including Health, Hunger, Energy, and Mood. Watch as they autonomously decide when to chop wood, mine rocks, or take a well-deserved break to eat based on their current stats.\r\n</li><li><strong>Deep Social Dynamics &amp; Families:</strong> Watch your village truly come to life! Colonists form relationships, establish family lineages, and even care for their newborns (keep an eye out for the adorable \ud83c\udf7c mood indicator!).\r\n</li><li><strong>Base Building &amp; Farming:</strong> Gather essential raw materials like Wood and Stone to construct sturdy houses for your people. Set up farming plots to grow crops and build animal pens to safely raise livestock for a steady food supply.\r\n</li><li><strong>Dynamic Environment:</strong> Experience a living world with a beautifully balanced day and night cycle. The environment is rich with trees, rocks, and a smart placement system that ensures your village always looks organic and natural.\r\n</li><li><strong>Survival &amp; Raids:</strong> Village life isn&#x27;t always entirely peaceful. Gather resources, prepare your settlement, and protect your hard-working colonists from unexpected outside raids!\r\n</li><li><strong>Detailed Inspector &amp; UI:</strong> A clean, intuitive user interface allows you to track global resources (Wood, Stone, Meat, Food) at a single glance. Use the interactive Inspector Panel to click on any villager, animal, or object to view their deep, hidden stats and inventory.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h3>\ud83c\udfae Controls</h3>\r\n<ul><li><strong>Camera Movement:</strong> Use <strong>W, A, S, D</strong> or <strong>Arrow Keys</strong> to pan the camera freely around your expanding village.\r\n</li><li><strong>Interact:</strong> <strong>Left-Click</strong> on any colonist, building, resource, or animal to open the Inspector Panel and manage your world. press the Q key to cancel the build button\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h3>\ud83d\udce6 About This Edition</h3>\r\n<p>This premium downloadable edition includes the complete, highly-optimized PC experience. Play in full-screen, immerse yourself in the village life, and enjoy all future content updates for free!\r\n</p>\r\n<p><em></em></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" aria-hidden width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1